==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 10.67~23.33 seconds<sup>320f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Although the enemies here are at a decent magnification, it is still extremely easy. [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] can easily destroy this stage. Alternatively, if you do not have Jamiera Cat, you can just spam [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]] with meatshields.

